  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Matchmaking AMUGA Invest International</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cote d&#x2019;Ivoire is a combi country for the Netherlands. Trade and water remains strategic pillars under the new policy framework for international cooperation and development. This matchmaking project aims to provide insights and connect Dutch companies to local companies in the water and infrastructure sector. This project aims to support Dutch companies to explore and better facilitate the business opportunities offered by the Invest International portfolio. This project will also establish structured matchmaking and networking mechanisms between Dutch and qualified local Ivorian firms to foster long term JVs, knowledge transfer and local capacity development supporting Invest International funded projects.</narrative>
  </description>
